    <node id="CHRONIC HEPATITIS">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Chronic hepatitis is long-term inflammation of the liver caused by hepatitis B or C infection, with potential progression to cirrhosis, liver failure, and liver cancer.
Relationships:
  - Source: CHRONIC HEPATITIS
  - Target: LIVER CANCER
  - Description: Chronic hepatitis can lead to liver cancer.
  - Source: CHRONIC HEPATITIS
  - Target: LIVER FAILURE
  - Description: Chronic hepatitis can lead to liver failure.
  - Source: CIRRHOSIS
  - Target: CHRONIC HEPATITIS
