  - Description: The HPV vaccine prevents new HPV infections.
  - Source: HPV
  - Target: CERVICAL INTRAEPITHELIAL NEOPLASIA (CIN)
  - Description: HPV infection causes abnormal cervical cell changes known as CIN or cervical dysplasia.

