**ENTITY: MATURE B-CELL ALL (BURKITT LEUKEMIA)**
Description: Mature B-cell ALL, also called Burkitt leukemia, is a rare subtype of B-ALL that is essentially the same as Burkitt lymphoma but is treated differently from B-ALL.
Relationships: (None explicitly listed in the provided data tables)

