  - Target: SURGICAL MENOPAUSE
  - Description: Preserving the ovaries during hysterectomy prevents surgical menopause from removal of both ovaries.
  - Source: OVARY PRESERVATION
  - Target: MENOPAUSE
  - Description: Preserving the ovaries prevents the sudden drop in estrogen that would cause menopause.
  - Source: HYSTERECTOMY
  - Target: OVARY PRESERVATION
  - Description: The ovaries may or may not be removed during hysterectomy; ovary preservation keeps them intact.</data>
