    <node id="OBSERVATION">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Observation is a post-surgery management option that involves regular monitoring without immediate treatment. It is specifically recommended for cases of cervical cancer that present without risk factors, where active surveillance is preferred over immediate intervention. This approach allows healthcare providers to track the patient's condition over time while avoiding unnecessary treatment in lower-risk situations.
