Description: A blood test measuring a small protein released by B cells; high levels may suggest CLL is growing.
Relationships:
  - Source: CLL
  - Target: BETA-2 MICROGLOBULIN
  - Description: Beta-2 microglobulin is a test used to plan CLL treatment.

