    <edge source="SYSTEMIC THERAPY" target="PLATINUM-BASED CHEMOTHERAPY" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Systemic therapy is a treatment approach used in cancer care, encompassing a range of drug-based treatments that circulate throughout the body. When systemic therapy is planned, platinum-based chemotherapy is a recommended option. This is particularly relevant in the context of metastatic cervical cancer, where systemic therapy is usually platinum-based chemotherapy. Thus, platinum-based chemotherapy serves as a key component of systemic therapy, especially for patients with metastatic cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d8">PLATINUM-BASED CHEMOTHERAPY</data>
    </edge>
