    <edge source="UNITED STATES" target="CERVICAL CANCER" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">In the United States, Pap smears have resulted in much lower rates of cervical cancer.</data>
