      <data key="d8">B-CELL ALL</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="APL" target="BPDCN" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">APL (acute promyelocytic leukemia) and BPDCN (blastic plasmacytoid dendritic cell neoplasm) are both recognized as subtypes of acute myeloid leukemia (AML). These two entities are addressed together in the same NCCN patient guidelines, which provide comprehensive guidance for patients and caregivers on these specific AML subtypes.</data>
      <data key="d8">BPDCN</data>
    </edge>
