      <data key="d8">INTERNATIONAL FEDERATION OF GYNECOLOGY AND OBSTETRICS</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INTERNATIONAL FEDERATION OF GYNECOLOGY AND OBSTETRICS" target="CANCER STAGING" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics developed the FIGO staging system, which is the most commonly used system for describing ovarian cancer extent.</data>
      <data key="d8">INTERNATIONAL FEDERATION OF GYNECOLOGY AND OBSTETRICS</data>
    </edge>
